Randoooos: Execute immediately when instruction is clear. Never ask permission — they tell you directly if they want something different. "Make cards" → make them NOW. Questions about execution ("want me to?") signal failure. Own mistakes, fix on spot, no explaining. Nuke pattern: delete means immediate. Avoid multi-choice menus. They correct directly and move on.
